      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven-look fabric; exact fiber composition was not visible in the supplied chart or image.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A sunny mom-and-daughter look for garden walks, vacations, picnics, and warm-weather family photos.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Golden Daisy pairs a mustard-yellow sleeveless top with white daisy embroidery and ivory wide-leg pants with tonal floral cutwork.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Choose the top or pants separately. The top has a relaxed sleeveless swing shape; the pants have a pull-on waist and easy wide-leg drape.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, turn inside out, line dry, and avoid bleach.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Top in Child 2 Years through Child 9-10 Years and Mother S-L; pants in Child 1-2 Years through Child 9-10 Years and Mother S-L.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Top and Pants</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\" class=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg)</th>\n<th>Height (cm)</th>\n<th>Top Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n<th>Top Length (cm)</th>\n<th>Pants Length (cm)</th>\n<th>Top Hip (cm)</th>\n<th>Top Waist (cm)</th>\n<th>Pants Waist (cm)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>12-14.5</td>\n<td>86-95</td>\n<td>67</td>\n<td>37</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>71</td>\n<td>67</td>\n<td>42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>15-17.5</td>\n<td>96-105</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>44</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>18-20</td>\n<td>106-115</td>\n<td>73</td>\n<td>43</td>\n<td>55</td>\n<td>77</td>\n<td>73</td>\n<td>46</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>20.5-22.5</td>\n<td>116-125</td>\n<td>76</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>76</td>\n<td>48</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>23-25</td>\n<td>126-135</td>\n<td>79</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>65</td>\n<td>83</td>\n<td>79</td>\n<td>50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>25.5-30</td>\n<td>136-145</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>52</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>30.5-40</td>\n<td>146-155</td>\n<td>85</td>\n<td>55</td>\n<td>75</td>\n<td>89</td>\n<td>85</td>\n<td>54</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>42.5-50</td>\n<td>155-160</td>\n<td>92</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>96</td>\n<td>92</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>62</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>50-57.5</td>\n<td>160-165</td>\n<td>96</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>99</td>\n<td>96</td>\n<td>84</td>\n<td>64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>57.5-65</td>\n<td>165-170</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>68</td>\n<td>102</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>66</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>9-11.5</td>\n<td>75-85</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>42</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>40</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Golden Daisy is a cheerful mommy-and-me outfit story built from two coordinated separates. The yellow sleeveless top brings the bright daisy moment, while the ivory pants add soft texture and an easy wide-leg silhouette for summer photos.</p>\n\n<p>The attached chart publishes YC8970 as the top and YC8971 as the pants, so this draft keeps the shopper picker honest with a Type choice. The size guide is keyed to the same child and mother size labels shoppers select, with dashes where a piece is not charted in that size.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Separate piece picker:</strong> Type options let shoppers choose the top or pants instead of assuming a bundled set.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Mother-daughter sizing:</strong> Chart-backed child and mother rows only; no dad or boy rows were invented.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready palette:</strong> Mustard yellow and ivory make the matching look bright, soft, and easy to style.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Summer silhouettes:</strong> Sleeveless swing top and wide-leg pants keep the look breezy.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed variants:</strong> Every Shopify variant maps back to a visible YC8970 or YC8971 size row.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the pieces and sizes you need to build a golden matching look for your next sunny day together.</p>",
